{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world of suspicion, deception and busy bodies. Welcome to <strong>Dahlia View</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/5d94a7fca8da95881aa17bacdcce978b.poster.avif?t=1770790485\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/5d94a7fca8da95881aa17bacdcce978b.webm?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/5d94a7fca8da95881aa17bacdcce978b.mp4?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 1950\u2019s cinema, White Paper Games brings you a detective thriller with twists, turns and accusations in a case that\u2019s taken the attention of an entire neighbourhood.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl has gone missing and your neighbours are acting suspiciously.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play the role of a retired detective, a detective that shouldn\u2019t be on the case, but who can\u2019t help themselves. You <i>need </i>to find the truth, a truth that will cause close relationships to fracture.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know from years of experience that when a child goes missing, it\u2019s often the people closest that know something. Since they won\u2019t give you the answers, you must take matters into your own hands. When a girl\u2019s life is at stake, etiquette goes out the window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How do you find the missing child?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By Spying</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the perfect view from your window, take that opportunity to spy on your neighbour\u2019s daily activities to see if they\u2019re hiding anything suspicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/241398a2838e287387fda56a77c4341a.poster.avif?t=1770790485\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/241398a2838e287387fda56a77c4341a.webm?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/241398a2838e287387fda56a77c4341a.mp4?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By Breaking and Entering</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You see something that piques  your curiosity, you can\u2019t help yourself. Break into areas you have no business being, pick locks that your neighbours think will protect their secrets, maybe take an item or two, for evidence of course\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/783975b77cc105020a070f1f5ef2f0bc.poster.avif?t=1770790485\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/783975b77cc105020a070f1f5ef2f0bc.webm?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/783975b77cc105020a070f1f5ef2f0bc.mp4?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By making your own deductions in classic detective style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re not holding your hands here. You\u2019re the detective, you have the evidence, now how does it connect? We\u2019ll leave that to you to figure out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/b4a51085e00ae315facd4941604d8463.poster.avif?t=1770790485\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/b4a51085e00ae315facd4941604d8463.webm?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/b4a51085e00ae315facd4941604d8463.mp4?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A young girl\u2019s life is at risk. Wouldn\u2019t you do anything you could to return her to her family?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ace Detective: McKee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1548750/5afb1a6f47b7f8a149584075cff579f0f70d46d3.jpg"},{"name":"Look Out Below!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1548750/f31347c0f2e5d302610ddcb3c67cedb63911a24a.jpg"},{"name":"Ace Detective: Levy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1548750/e3cb24f351067d8bd02c20b048fddddc5a292aec.jpg"},{"name":"Family Reunion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1548750/79afdf8ae8ff38e58a722fc9b2a83785175b33b1.jpg"},{"name":"Ace Detective: Doerr","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1548750/c6dd20c1f94eb1a3529bb83818b955108ff9332d.jpg"},{"name":"One Hundred & Eighty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1548750/f6dc620d7662975ade9a3aa671edfb85cb0bce94.jpg"},{"name":"Ace Detective: Downes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1548750/3aadcecd2642c1b075dc31d567fb0517c55c0675.jpg"},{"name":"Marling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1548750/4f1bb2eca86cab6ace4561d24d1b4b54cdbfef0d.jpg"},{"name":"Observant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1548750/e8b87246e3c9a76ddbeca11e89cf531a8d41e5f3.jpg"},{"name":"Profiler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1548750/54a9f6948df29dc894ce4a9ed909a81a7c356190.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1548750?t=1770790485","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770790485","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/f152db7aed82b2261592c9a2331f0b55b899d3b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770790485","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/f152db7aed82b2261592c9a2331f0b55b899d3b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770790485","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Game is based around child abduction. Speculation on the fate of the child at various points, which could be considered mature. Some shown violence but also some implied that is not shown. Some implied sexual references but not directly discussed or shown. There is the presence of smoking and cigarettes, as well as an explorable pub and so the presence of alcohol. Presence of prescription drugs but not used by the player."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world of suspicion, deception and busy bodies. Welcome to <strong>Dahlia View</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/5d94a7fca8da95881aa17bacdcce978b.poster.avif?t=1770790485\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/5d94a7fca8da95881aa17bacdcce978b.webm?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/5d94a7fca8da95881aa17bacdcce978b.mp4?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 1950\u2019s cinema, White Paper Games brings you a detective thriller with twists, turns and accusations in a case that\u2019s taken the attention of an entire neighbourhood.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl has gone missing and your neighbours are acting suspiciously.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play the role of a retired detective, a detective that shouldn\u2019t be on the case, but who can\u2019t help themselves. You <i>need </i>to find the truth, a truth that will cause close relationships to fracture.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know from years of experience that when a child goes missing, it\u2019s often the people closest that know something. Since they won\u2019t give you the answers, you must take matters into your own hands. When a girl\u2019s life is at stake, etiquette goes out the window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How do you find the missing child?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By Spying</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the perfect view from your window, take that opportunity to spy on your neighbour\u2019s daily activities to see if they\u2019re hiding anything suspicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/241398a2838e287387fda56a77c4341a.poster.avif?t=1770790485\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/241398a2838e287387fda56a77c4341a.webm?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/241398a2838e287387fda56a77c4341a.mp4?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By Breaking and Entering</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You see something that piques  your curiosity, you can\u2019t help yourself. Break into areas you have no business being, pick locks that your neighbours think will protect their secrets, maybe take an item or two, for evidence of course\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/783975b77cc105020a070f1f5ef2f0bc.poster.avif?t=1770790485\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/783975b77cc105020a070f1f5ef2f0bc.webm?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/783975b77cc105020a070f1f5ef2f0bc.mp4?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By making your own deductions in classic detective style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re not holding your hands here. You\u2019re the detective, you have the evidence, now how does it connect? We\u2019ll leave that to you to figure out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/b4a51085e00ae315facd4941604d8463.poster.avif?t=1770790485\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/b4a51085e00ae315facd4941604d8463.webm?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/b4a51085e00ae315facd4941604d8463.mp4?t=1770790485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A young girl\u2019s life is at risk. Wouldn\u2019t you do anything you could to return her to her family?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["White Paper Games"],"dlc":[1802380],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a