":"16","reviews":"\u201cSimply one of the best narrative adventure games I\u2019ve played all year, enhanced by fantastic voice acting, well-written dialogue, and an exciting and intriguing story.\u201d<br>9.5/10 \u2013 GamePitt<br><br>\u201cIf you like tense mysteries and slow-burning thrillers, Conway: Disappearance at Dahlia View really ought to be high on your most-wanted list\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 GameSpew<br><br>\u201cDahlia View succeeds with its Rear Window-esque voyeurism matching up appropriately to its on-the-ground sleuthing\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Screen Rant<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/ss_a22df8bffb874f8830701b6b1f7b1e5d5de3bbdb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770790485","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/ss_a22df8bffb874f8830701b6b1f7b1e5d5de3bbdb.600x338.jpg?t=1770790485"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/48585cae3de2434e5968f4340ac6ca606bcc5e6e/ss_48585cae3de2434e5968f4340ac6ca606bcc5e6e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770790485","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/48585cae3de2434e5968f4340ac6ca606bcc5e6e/ss_48585cae3de2434e5968f4340ac6ca606bcc5e6e.600x338.jpg?t=1770790485"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/ss_1dde1b5bbb435ab4df0191530746aa4ee4b69abb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770790485","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/ss_1dde1b5bbb435ab4df0191530746aa4ee4b69abb.600x338.jpg?t=1770790485"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/6eca9d196c18d661772985d2b84588626f5db98b/ss_6eca9d196c18d661772985d2b84588626f5db98b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770790485","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/6eca9d196c18d661772985d2b